  <body>
    <div>
      <p begin="00:00.130" end="00:06.220" ttm:agent="v1">One, two, one, two, three, ah</p>
      <p begin="00:06.220" end="00:07.720" ttm:agent="v1">Yeah, ah, ah</p>
      <p begin="00:07.670" end="00:09.570" ttm:agent="v1">Call me on my phone ring-ringin'</p>
      <p begin="00:09.570" end="00:13.060" ttm:agent="v1">I don't wanna answer unless, oh, baby, it's you</p>
      <p begin="00:13.060" end="00:15.310" ttm:agent="v1">All I want is you</p>
      <p begin="00:15.310" end="00:19.670" ttm:agent="v1">I think we'd be cute together, call me back tonight</p>
      <p begin="00:19.670" end="00:24.820" ttm:agent="v1">Oh, baby, you, all I want is you</p>
      <p begin="00:24.820" end="00:28.490" ttm:agent="v1">Only you could give me butterflies</p>
      <p begin="00:28.490" end="00:31.240" ttm:agent="v1">I feel like I can fly when I'm with</p>
      <p begin="00:31.240" end="00:33.230" ttm:agent="v1">You, yeah, I'm up right now</p>
      <p begin="00:33.230" end="00:35.280" ttm:agent="v1">Bad lil' thing got me good right now</p>
      <p begin="00:35.280" end="00:37.900" ttm:agent="v1">I got some other onlookers look at us like, &quot;How?&quot;</p>
      <p begin="00:37.900" end="00:40.800" ttm:agent="v1">Did a man like me pull a girl like you? Wow</p>
      <p begin="00:40.800" end="00:42.720" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Make me say it twice, echo (echo)</p>
      <p begin="00:42.720" end="00:45.420" ttm:agent="v1">The role you play in my life, it's instrumental</p>
      <p begin="00:45.420" end="00:47.430" ttm:agent="v1">Please, call me on my phone ring-ringin'</p>
      <p begin="00:47.430" end="00:50.900" ttm:agent="v1">I don't wanna answer unless, oh, baby, it's you</p>
      <p begin="00:50.900" end="00:53.390" ttm:agent="v1">All I want is you</p>
      <p begin="00:53.390" end="00:57.870" ttm:agent="v1">I think we'd be cute together, call me back tonight</p>
      <p begin="00:57.870" end="01:02.870" ttm:agent="v1">Oh, baby, you, all I want is you</p>
      <p begin="01:02.870" end="01:06.440" ttm:agent="v1">Only you could give me butterflies</p>
      <p begin="01:06.440" end="01:09.220" ttm:agent="v1">I feel like I can fly when I'm with</p>
      <p begin="01:09.220" end="01:11.270" ttm:agent="v1">You, yeah, I'm up right now, uh</p>
      <p begin="01:11.270" end="01:13.410" ttm:agent="v1">Head up in the clouds, no, I can't come down</p>
      <p begin="01:13.410" end="01:15.630" ttm:agent="v1">You an angel, way you fly right now</p>
      <p begin="01:15.630" end="01:19.040" ttm:agent="v1">And when you walk in the room all the eyes on you, wow</p>
      <p begin="01:19.040" end="01:21.050" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Make me look twice, mirror (mirror)</p>
      <p begin="01:21.050" end="01:23.420" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">All these visions of you couldn't be clearer (clearer)</p>
      <p begin="01:23.420" end="01:25.460" ttm:agent="v1">And when you call me on my phone ring-ringin'</p>
      <p begin="01:25.460" end="01:29.180" ttm:agent="v1">I don't wanna answer unless, oh, baby, it's you</p>
      <p begin="01:29.180" end="01:31.530" ttm:agent="v1">All I want is you</p>
      <p begin="01:31.530" end="01:35.670" ttm:agent="v1">I think we'd be cute together, call me back tonight</p>
      <p begin="01:35.670" end="01:40.950" ttm:agent="v1">Oh, baby, you, all I want is you</p>
      <p begin="01:40.950" end="01:44.500" ttm:agent="v1">Only you could give me butterflies</p>
      <p begin="01:44.500" end="01:47.520" ttm:agent="v1">I feel like I can fly when I'm with you</p>
      <p begin="01:47.520" end="01:51.570" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">You drive me wild (you drive me wild)</p>
      <p begin="01:51.570" end="01:53.880" ttm:agent="v1">Whenever you're around</p>
      <p begin="01:53.880" end="01:57.160" ttm:agent="v1">My heart turns upside down when I'm with you</p>
      <p begin="01:57.160" end="02:01.160" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">This angel light (this angel light)</p>
      <p begin="02:01.160" end="02:03.300" ttm:agent="v1">I know you like it bright</p>
      <p begin="02:03.300" end="02:07.380" ttm:agent="v1">'Cause I can hear your heart, it beats like</p>
      <p begin="02:07.380" end="02:11.240" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Yeah, yeah (yeah)</p>
      <p begin="02:11.240" end="02:13.010" ttm:agent="v1">Call me on my phone ring-ringin'</p>
      <p begin="02:13.010" end="02:16.580" ttm:agent="v1">I don't wanna answer unless, oh, baby, it's you</p>
      <p begin="02:16.580" end="02:18.850" ttm:agent="v1">All I want is you</p>
      <p begin="02:18.850" end="02:23.330" ttm:agent="v1">I think we'd be cute together, call me back tonight</p>
      <p begin="02:23.330" end="02:28.510" ttm:agent="v1">Oh, baby, you, all I want is you</p>
      <p begin="02:28.510" end="02:31.950" ttm:agent="v1">Only you could give me butterflies</p>
      <p begin="02:31.950" end="02:34.420" ttm:agent="v1">I feel like I can fly when I'm with</p>
      <p begin="02:34.420" end="02:38.420" ttm:agent="v1"/>
    </div>
